{"reviewId": "245728698_8bIdBjI4O", "review": {"abstract": "需要注意的是，如果按照繁荣、衰退、萧条、回升四个阶段来划分康波，康波的顶指的是衰退期的结束，也就是说，繁荣和衰退是康波的上升期。而康波的谷指的是回升的结束，也就是说，萧条和回升是康波的下降期。", "atUserVids": [], "bookId": "3300128305", "bookVersion": 1748903449, "chapterName": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "chapterUid": 6, "content": "顶和谷的价格怎么是一样的？", "contextAbstract": "", "friendship": 0, "htmlContent": "", "isPrivate": 0, "notVisibleToFriends": 0, "onlyVisibleOneBook": 1, "range": "2025-2121", "createTime": 1787970277, "title": "", "type": 1, "chapterIdx": 6, "reviewId": "245728698_8bIdBjI4O", "userVid": 245728698, "topics": [], "flag": 1073741824, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "author": {"userVid": 245728698, "name": "hyorpio", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0004-J52C11L2OZwUQE4QAL0eCa4/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "hyorpio", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "常学常新 常思常悟", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-100", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 100}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 0, "likes": [], "commentsCount": 1, "hotComments": [], "comments": [{"content": "不知道康波这个图的纵坐标是什么。我感觉它这么说可能纵坐标是经济增长速率？繁荣衰退速率是正的，所以衰退期结束是顶？", "reviewId": "245728698_8bIdBjI4O", "commentId": "245728698_8bIdBjI4O_c923101888_8bIP9AG2M", "userVid": 923101888, "createTime": 1788004680, "author": {"userVid": 923101888, "name": "Arielle", "avatar": "https://res.weread.qq.com/wravatar/WV0029-r293_JZtuL0NGyxEBGj7hf8/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "nick": "Arielle", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": ""